				1461b30
			</span></i>: esp. of adding articles to statements or documents, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσθεῖναι οὐδὲν εἶχον τοῖς
					εἰρημένοις οὐδ᾽ ἀφελεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					12.264
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1062.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ
				ἀφελεῖν τι περὶ τῆς ξυμμαχίας</span> Foed. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὶ πρὸς τοῖς
