				Plb.
				21.43.27
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὅτι . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.231
				</span></i>
			; of entries in accounts, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσετέθη τὰ τέλη τῷ κυριακῷ λόγῳ</span>”
