					<u>PAmh.</u>
					77.15
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				620.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινὶ
				[ἀργύριον</span>] <i>pay,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMich.Zen.
				28.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				647.56
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				153.27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσθες εἰς ὄνομα
				Ἐπωνύχου</span>
			<i>credit</i> to account of <i><span class="en">E.,
					<u>Ostr.</u>1159</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A.D.)</span>; <i>pay in, deposit</i> gold in a bank
