			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc. pers., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνα τῇδε
				προστιθῶ στάσει</span>; <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				114
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀθηναίοις π. σφᾶς αὐτούς</span>
