        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Math.,
				<i>add</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πὸτ ἀριθμόν . . φᾶφον</span>”
