			 (prob.); [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρίον] ἕτερον αὐτῷ τουτὶ ἴσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Men.</u>
					84d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς πεπερασμένον ἀεὶ π</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				266b2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ κα . . ποτὶ τὸ ἕτερον τῶν βαρέων
