					ποτετέθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archim.
					<u>Aequil.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Def.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Euc.
				1
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>Ax.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, etc.; 
