				<u>EN</u>
				1147b33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				LXX
			</span></i> and <i>NT, continue</i> or <i>repeat</i> an action, c.
				inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέθηκεν ἔτι λαλῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					18.29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ προσθήσω ἔτι πατάξαι</span>
