				LXX
				<u>Jb.</u>
				27.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσθεὶς εἶπε παραβολήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					19.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσθεῖσα ἔτεκεν υἱόν</span>
