				18.39
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>assent, agree</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔ οἱ ἔγωγε π. τῇ γνώμῃ</span>”
